# Prose is authored, not generated. Formatting markdown creates churn on
# documents the orchestrator and humans both write (README, PRD, ADRs,
# CONTEXT.md) without improving anything.
*.md

# The orchestrator writes ~35 differently-named run artifacts into the repo
# root (validation.result, review-loop-history.json, task-manifest.json, ...)
# and hides them in .git/info/exclude, which prettier does not read and which
# is not even a resolvable path inside a git worktree. Enumerating those names
# here would drift the moment a new artifact is added, so ignore root-level
# JSON by default and re-include this repository's own configuration.
/*.json
!/package.json
!/tsconfig.json
!/tsconfig.base.json
!/.prettierrc.json
!/.ai-orchestrator.json
ai/
